# TypeScript Style

- Avoid **`let`** when possible; restructure with `const` without hurting readability.
- When comparing one variable against **three or more** distinct constant values, use a **`switch`** instead of a chain of `if`/`else if`. Be exhaustive and call **`assertNever()`** in the default branch.
